                <syl /><neume facs="#m-6876b05d-6eda-481e-8489-be275c4c1048" type="podatus" xml:id="m-e6ac16eb-7665-46f8-8312-237a48d3a3dc">
                  <nc xml:id="m-c8f3acbe-bc34-4330-bff6-a40f87930954" pname="f" oct="3" /><nc xml:id="m-30df180e-cced-4c37-a8a9-e13604e83944" pname="g" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-f21ed4af-cdd0-4160-b45c-ed51cfe16095">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-fe11e614-2949-4b34-a6c1-3e70e05f6b2d" type="punctum" xml:id="m-afd4ca46-a619-4bb6-94ed-c4b01c66dc40">
                  <nc xml:id="m-2d6639e0-bffa-4c9f-a617-f6c3941a9382" pname="g" oct="3">
                    <signifLet xml:id="m-4ca30822-3ec1-4b6d-8ffb-245da1e9f63c" /></nc></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-542b85b4-0998-44e9-ae94-bec67e45c1d9">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-7ed7d600-2c96-4fcd-963b-72aab6b9a248" type="punctum" xml:id="m-c2c083f3-2907-4544-a5b0-3f51916518fd">
                  <nc xml:id="m-d31a2615-7090-4cc7-8923-305fca8a56ee" pname="g" oct="3">
                    <signifLet xml:id="m-6779e761-4ef3-4ee8-9c5c-62950cd4afbb" /></nc></neume></syllable><divLine xml:id="m-e0e2e03f-736f-409b-8cfc-810d534c7b52" facs="#m-5fbc6269-ac29-42be-8cb8-0c7da278434c" form="finalis" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-3e1eb761-f43c-4ffb-9ce2-75500f3ac215"><lg xml:id="m-cd4a12e7-f93f-4a3c-9b95-a78f33e4ba20"><l xml:id="m-840ab77d-2b67-4f91-92e5-31ef743b4966" facs="#m-a6cc5dc3-84bd-4369-b4cb-bdc330f1532c" label="ambiguous">—</l><l xml:id="m-770656bc-5979-431a-82b8-9c53af08c3d8" facs="#m-37cc0fd3-a91b-4985-912e-f682d4c0d595" label="text-like">Procession to beg for Rain.</l><l xml:id="m-7d7c4bda-6cdf-4dd7-ae98-784e211ed3c8" facs="#m-548c6844-9519-4447-bf53-9a0d9e66a286" label="ambiguous">1838</l><l xml:id="m-acf016c2-63ca-4568-a88e-0d2b3e82705e" facs="#m-0dd9fcda-7cb6-4724-8534-44ac0f6bb990" label="lyrics-like">per diversi-tá-tem linguárum cunctárum, géntes in uni-tá¬</l><l xml:id="m-2f7fc2b5-c8b7-45da-900b-3db070353418" facs="#m-4157e41e-8d80-46bd-906f-1d7dd75bb986" label="lyrics-like">te fi-de-i congregásti.</l><l xml:id="m-9819310f-4f27-43a3-8146-262d8b42518d" facs="#m-380f91d8-d60a-4718-a7b2-a66e3c4636f3" label="lyrics-like">Hymn. Véni Creátor. p. 885.</l><l xml:id="m-d4d58b0e-e023-4b14-8a2c-9e961c3d7a7b" facs="#m-3d05a0d5-869b-4f0d-8561-0c66ab2c6b69" label="lyrics-like">V. Emitte Spiritum túum, et creabúntur.</l><l xml:id="m-c73b9629-1264-4da4-a2e8-765911b11fb9" facs="#m-e6390b09-c779-4bc2-be5f-5141a7742924" label="lyrics-like">R. Et renovãbis fáciem térrae.</l><l xml:id="m-306a10fe-1c10-468e-9e60-c521b8fdea10" facs="#m-6184128c-ff96-4146-aa79-c2c5a837297b" label="lyrics-like">Orémus.</l><l xml:id="m-a9ee0ace-cf81-4a24-85ec-ea03fbaf625c" facs="#m-adebf992-1788-4180-a51c-b81126d2919c" label="text-like">Prayer.</l><l xml:id="m-a2827d70-39de-46e6-90d7-308c5e2b4c4b" facs="#m-3b8acfeb-d030-4aa9-82ac-10ff2dd89720" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui corda fidélium Sancti! sápere, * et de eius semper conso¬</l><l xml:id="m-eecd317e-926d-4c8d-97e9-6e1a683a067a" facs="#m-51ee53f8-5edb-472f-b5f7-99f88f7c2d81" label="lyrics-like">O Spíritus illustratióne docuisti:!] latióne gaudére. Per Christum Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-ce111108-d386-4551-a408-ed1220b7c9ec" facs="#m-1ec15dc8-823f-4415-badf-1e0cb93db6e6" label="lyrics-like">da nobis in eódem Spíritu recta! minum nostrum. B. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-ac990104-a972-4599-b5cf-088cc95f2bfc" facs="#m-9cfd9ac2-689a-4507-adfc-464e26015429" label="text-like">Procession to beg for Rain.</l><l xml:id="m-29d479d5-412b-4a2d-9cb2-2cde33a1980e" facs="#m-b7283c44-57f8-4a06-b595-2f3ac174a533" label="lyrics-like">All as at the Greater Litantes, p. 835, but after the V. Ut ómnibus fidé¬</l><l xml:id="m-547aa504-18cb-45a0-8b9f-e2087d2f05c6" facs="#m-a9c0f29c-c02b-455a-8fe4-66a74095c0d1" label="lyrics-like">libus defúnctis... the following invocation is soid twice:</l><l xml:id="m-5fe776cf-c9cc-4af9-abbb-18e5194f662a" facs="#m-6e525124-ebe5-444c-a227-0d9577292e25" label="lyrics-like">Ut congruéntem plúviam fidélibus tuis concédere dignéris: Te rogá¬</l><l xml:id="m-a26abdef-42a1-4abe-a466-c1281a551ee5" facs="#m-7d3170fa-5caa-42c3-8f78-0903ca123a97" label="ambiguous">mus audi nos.</l><l xml:id="m-fc7a8cbd-4d02-469c-9461-3f41b16e9e1e" facs="#m-b94ef4d9-8f4f-4a97-afc7-ba4f046a7d7c" label="lyrics-like">At the end of the Litany, Páter nóster. is said ond continued in silence up to.</l><l xml:id="m-d2043229-5ba9-4f19-baee-5df3feeed23e" facs="#m-89c61fdc-59bc-417c-8c9c-97a68630757e" label="lyrics-like">V. Et ne nos indúcas in tentatiónem. E. Sed libera nos a málo.</l><l xml:id="m-9221cb69-a9b7-4579-a34b-95d9f6640a1b" facs="#m-5baacf83-0183-4eaa-954a-45083cca073f" label="lyrics-like">Praecínite Dómino in confessió¬</l><l xml:id="m-ea33c023-5dfe-49d1-83ab-9f6ac82bd2db" facs="#m-7bdf141a-05c0-48e4-a0d0-367274982e9d" label="ambiguous">Psalm 146.</l><l xml:id="m-80f2b476-87ee-4890-adb3-b2fb34b139cd" facs="#m-bea00454-6ad7-4e0f-a78d-9d1d16ab293c" label="lyrics-like">(The Tone in directum is used, p. 889.) ne :*psállite Déo nóstro in cithara.</l><l xml:id="m-a9426757-3c9a-478f-88ac-ff2720959069" facs="#m-dedfd72c-a50b-4f56-bcc2-2e9176d609dc" label="lyrics-like">Qui óperit coélum núbibus:*et</l><l xml:id="m-618219b4-c5d4-418e-ae4f-834f6b390817" facs="#m-dfc4a6bc-9628-411b-9e09-c05aa3a4d552" label="lyrics-like">Audáte Dóminum quóniam bó¬</l><l xml:id="m-f9ef5241-1218-481e-be21-95d26a52d817" facs="#m-fa71daaa-07d4-48b8-9ad5-900992dbd71f" label="lyrics-like">párat térrae plúviam.</l><l xml:id="m-931c194a-4ad2-4fe8-b85a-56a2dfb01f81" facs="#m-87f3c663-a190-4521-9dd2-1cd8c49e7d79" label="lyrics-like">Anus est psálmus: * Déo nóstro</l><l xml:id="m-4964ba91-0431-4437-b181-b03660739c65" facs="#m-f2e2726c-a338-4471-9f08-c47ec37dbf34" label="lyrics-like">Qui prodúcit in móntibus foé¬</l><l xml:id="m-3d8e5b98-3057-482b-9bcc-35707b733d5c" facs="#m-c5c5d671-f776-4543-91d8-5f7b1a791e78" label="lyrics-like">sit jucúnda decoráque laudátio.</l><l xml:id="m-72dbf331-0337-4e60-894c-23a77ddc11b3" facs="#m-13ea5e01-66e6-40f5-bb12-ccd94716f83f" label="lyrics-like">num:" et hérbam servitúti hómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-35fa59ab-1bab-48de-b9d4-e34b1bd39585" facs="#m-285cebb5-b6b7-4fbb-b77a-aac9a0052ecc" label="lyrics-like">Aedificans Jerúsãlem Dominus:</l><l xml:id="m-9b5665ff-915a-44e3-a0bd-e8e67c4e1b5f" facs="#m-5f1daea9-b26f-4712-a4fe-d2cc6a63216b" label="lyrics-like">dispersiónes Israélis congregábit.</l><l xml:id="m-3b3b829f-ca47-40cf-9342-2d7f58361763" facs="#m-3a0a7b24-b3fd-4432-b74e-228b8d731ff5" label="ambiguous">num.</l><l xml:id="m-7ca6192c-b365-435d-94ca-668fb792ebcf" facs="#m-78235a6a-75b7-48d8-ad28-2f52fa4c0ec6" label="lyrics-like">Qui dat juméntis éscam ipsó¬</l><l xml:id="m-669c9578-0287-4960-8a5b-87eefed1505c" facs="#m-c208d4ac-3ec0-4df4-82b3-a92bbda08a08" label="lyrics-like">Qui sánat contritos córde:“et</l><l xml:id="m-8e68b541-944e-4c09-8596-4fae39222067" facs="#m-0521da6e-4eab-477d-9ac2-7b1644646262" label="lyrics-like">rum: * et púllis corvórum invo¬</l><l xml:id="m-50a53908-d0fd-4791-bd6e-35763c02a61d" facs="#m-7251fe78-5960-4d79-8540-e488d4a2ed15" label="lyrics-like">álligat contritiónes eórum.</l><l xml:id="m-8c2ade0d-7aa8-4afb-8aa0-72c033bf686f" facs="#m-c40dd54f-761f-4a7b-aaa4-523275377495" label="lyrics-like">cántibus éum.</l><l xml:id="m-087c2f22-97ff-4a51-85fa-8cda06c765da" facs="#m-63f399d2-1c5b-424c-9a01-2fa525051f0a" label="lyrics-like">Qui númerat multitúdinem stedlá¬</l><l xml:id="m-9dfde00c-1a6b-4165-8001-76a9ffabe52d" facs="#m-03964e1c-9004-4248-8bc9-b3fd9c369d64" label="lyrics-like">Non in fortitúdine équi voluntá¬</l><l xml:id="m-551dc988-017d-4404-953d-6df616c16495" facs="#m-0e2d9878-9d81-4617-82eb-39dd867873b0" label="lyrics-like">rum:* et ómnibus éis nómina vócat.</l><l xml:id="m-18573594-c3ef-46e3-b8af-1040d669e02f" facs="#m-38d5cd7e-c8bb-4382-870c-830830d2a3ed" label="lyrics-like">tem habébit:* nec in tibiis viri</l><l xml:id="m-a65bca19-db8d-4f34-ac05-7f1b5aa57a59" facs="#m-aeae27a0-0530-439e-8e18-a4577955fd80" label="lyrics-like">Mágnus Dóminus nóster, et má¬</l><l xml:id="m-6c96ca6b-d6e4-444a-ad97-8f85d1d62fe7" facs="#m-d6d07218-4262-4f92-b51c-adb8e4a36920" label="lyrics-like">beneplácitum érit éi.</l><l xml:id="m-c60054db-114b-411d-8244-cbae929e115c" facs="#m-f95e82c1-286e-4941-8bef-b6d1b7a4a1cb" label="lyrics-like">gna virtus éjus:*et sapiéntiae éjus</l><l xml:id="m-8dea3fb5-ab3f-435e-8cc2-6a191d93ee8b" facs="#m-39383b78-dfc8-462a-9e27-596c3f4fd229" label="lyrics-like">Beneplácitum est Dómino supet</l><l xml:id="m-8e6a937d-3cd2-4d8f-99cd-44dd13c02178" facs="#m-591bbcf7-97f8-46ec-9199-be174e738a8c" label="lyrics-like">non est númerus.</l><l xml:id="m-ea8e9efa-232d-4fea-9c68-b9d9a0cb3903" facs="#m-bb18c581-1027-4c1a-9d7a-669bdf9a4f1c" label="lyrics-like">timéntes éum, * et in éis qui spé</l><l xml:id="m-073adf06-2dea-48a9-9dc9-9babb79524f5" facs="#m-95fdd43b-84ba-4a22-a1a3-173cf5c86740" label="lyrics-like">Suscípiens mansuétos Dóminus:"</l><l xml:id="m-ee1b0348-8822-42f1-be49-3014e6d71634" facs="#m-dad18448-0418-4739-b6e6-35ed9e6b7b6a" label="lyrics-like">humilians autem peccatóres usque rant super misericórdia éjus.</l><l xml:id="m-0727797b-9efe-4f6a-9959-78a7ccec0d93" facs="#m-3ff50e4e-38b1-41f4-9356-4c3f8c01e645" label="lyrics-like">Glória Pá̂tri.</l><l xml:id="m-439c47ff-84a1-4915-868a-262b6ef2025e" facs="#m-611082db-017f-4f63-9ec0-ec907f604e7b" label="lyrics-like">ad térram.</l><l xml:id="m-eaa66b47-7e2b-48ab-805c-cb911f427d89" facs="#m-b70a1522-35fa-46cb-a37b-711203b99d68" label="lyrics-like">V. Operi Dómine caélum núbibus. B. Et pára térrae plúviam.</l><l xml:id="m-3aca88c8-2c7e-491c-8630-4fea41757185" facs="#m-b376023c-db64-44f4-a6fb-9635a5c0dea2" label="lyrics-like">Y. Ut prodúcat in móntibus foénum.</l><l xml:id="m-397e5b64-8ffc-4720-aa88-c9cb239543ab" facs="#m-0a5ce3e5-d421-4c53-9551-93d345aae56c" label="lyrics-like">R. Et hérbam servitúti hóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-74320bee-fe96-4bf0-b4d1-7dd92d8efb2a" facs="#m-d2a3c8ae-46b2-49ed-a022-9e829137a725" label="lyrics-like">V. Ríga móntes de superióribus túis.</l><l xml:id="m-d826de78-eaf7-4e40-9e2e-ffb2defa76cc" facs="#m-696c05e4-1aa5-4312-a058-f7308fe46140" label="lyrics-like">R. Et de frúctu óperum tuórum satiábitur térra.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>